Well, we reached out to both of them to hear what it was like to be paired together on this

205
00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:05.630
episode.

206
00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:10.170
So they said that Greg just paired them together because he thought it would be kind of fun.

207
00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.950
And Justin told me that they basically just split it down the middle, that Brent took a

208
00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:15.930
