00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:22.950
And then they came together one afternoon and they kind of went over it.

212
00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:29.310
And since Brent was the senior writer, he kind of took the lead on a kind of a dual rewrite.

213
00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:34.710
And then they turned it in and it was kind of, you know, punched up by the staff like every other

214
00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.190
